# Python local-dev artifacts — LOCAL DEVELOPER ERGONOMICS ONLY.
# CI never relies on these to forgive writes: its cleanliness assertion uses
# `git status --porcelain=v1 --untracked-files=all --ignored=matching`, which
# fails on any tracked, untracked, OR ignored in-tree delta (design D10).
# The packaged mirror src/se_agent/_payload/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
